  "notes": "{変動|へんどう} refers to fluctuation or change — often unpredictable shifts in values, conditions, or situations.\n\nFORMS:\n⟦{変|へん}→変：01124_hen⟧ (change) + {動|どう} (movement).\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{気候|きこう}→気候：00231_kikou⟧{変動|へんどう}: climate change\n- ⟦{価格|かかく}→価格：00147_kakaku⟧{変動|へんどう}: price fluctuation\n- ⟦{為替|かわせ}→為替：04021_kawase⟧{変動|へんどう}: exchange rate fluctuation\n- {変動|へんどう}⟦{相場|そうば}→相場：07668_souba⟧: floating exchange rate\n- {変動|へんどう}{金利|きんり}: variable interest rate\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {変動|へんどう}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to fluctuate, to shift\n- {変動|へんどう}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{激|はげ}しい→激しい：02348_hageshii⟧: fluctuations are severe\n- {変動|へんどう}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{大|おお}きい→大きい：00335_ookii⟧: large fluctuations\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {変動|へんどう}: fluctuation, change (emphasizes instability and movement)\n- ⟦{変化|へんか}→変化：03615_henka⟧: change (more general, can be gradual or stable)\n- ⟦{変遷|へんせん}→変遷：05571_hensen⟧: transition, historical change (long-term shifts)",
